# parser), so each spaced slug is percent-encoded here; mixed-case + the
# apostrophe in "Where's" are kept literal (valid URL path chars, never
# browser-encoded — that is the form search engines indexed). Destination = the
# new kebab slug = its content/p/<slug>.mdx filename. FIRST-MATCH-WINS; these
